  "help": "<div class=\"section\" id=\"what-it-does\">\n<h1><strong>What it does</strong></h1>\n<p>After running Kraken, Kraken2, or KrakenUniq, users may use the\n<cite>extract_kraken_reads.py</cite> program to extract the FASTA or FASTQ reads\nclassified as a specific taxonomy ID. For example, this program can be used to\nextract all bacterial reads or only reads assigned to Escherichia coli. Users\nmust provide (at minimum) the original sequence file(s), at least one taxonomy\nID, and the Kraken output file.</p>\n</div>\n",
  "help_format": "restructuredtext",
